# Word lock files
~$*

# Student records. Never version-controlled: names, emails, grades, and notes
# about identifiable students stay on local disk only. The leading underscore
# also keeps the folder out of ./build and the site index.
_students/

# Set texts in copyright. This repository is public, so third-party editions
# stay on local disk: keep a reading here and cite it by page, the way
# 479-fall-2026/hegel-experience links Pinkard's Phenomenology to the copy
# marxists.org hosts. Course-authored readings belong in a plain `readings/`.
_readings/
